### /app/README.md
# pysed

A Python replacement for GNU sed 4.9, for the minimal images that ship
without sed.

- `pysed/sed.py` — the command (`python3 /app/pysed/sed.py ...`)
- `docs/sed.txt` — the GNU sed manual


### /app/pysed/sed.py
"""pysed: a GNU sed 4.9 replacement in pure Python.

Usage: python3 /app/pysed/sed.py [OPTION]... {script-only-if-no-other-script} [input-file]...
"""

import sys


def main(argv):
    sys.stderr.write("pysed: not implemented yet\n")
    return 4


if __name__ == "__main__":
    sys.exit(main(sys.argv[1:]))

